## The script will generate two visualizations:

PCA 2D projection

LDA projection highlighting class separability

## Conclusion

This project demonstrates the application of PCA and LDA for dimensionality reduction on a real-world medical dataset.
PCA provides an unsupervised view of the data structure, while LDA leverages class labels to improve discrimination between healthy and diseased patients. 
These techniques form a fundamental part of exploratory data analysis and preprocessing in machine learning pipelines.
